// ADR 0068 §4: Clock and Random are local effects. B10: a rule may not
// draw, since its answer would change from call to call; it takes the draw
// as a parameter. Two declarations in one file, so G1 also fires,
// incidentally but correctly.
rule rollDie() -> int {
    return Random.int(min: 1, max: 6)
}

// P8: there is nothing to require. An activity or a gateway calls Random
// directly.
gateway newSessionToken() -> string
    requires Random
{
    return Random.uuid()
}
